      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Powered suit on your back, blaster in your hands. Every piece of it came out of GregTech machines, not a crafting table.\n\nFrom here, LuV recipes move to the Assembly Line. A weapon needs a research item scanned first, so keep a spare of whatever you want to unlock: an Alien Blaster needs a De-Atomizer Pistol, a Nether Blaster needs a Blaster Rifle. The line also asks for lubricant and more soldering alloy.\n\nHSS-G is the gate material at LuV, so start your HSS-G line now. The coins and the bag below are yours to spend while you set it up.\n\n[note]This capstone pays double, with a second bag. The coins spend at the Vending Machine.[/note]",
